637662","text":"突发：人民币以后冻结钱更方便了！\n\n——数字人民币真的要来了——\n高校已经开始用于发工资！\n\n这都不是重点，\n重点是用这个：冻结更方便、无隐私、用途限制 ……全部都是so easy\n\n不信？看图一，\n中国银行数字人民币钱包协议明确规定：运营机构可在无需用户确认的情况下停用钱包，停用后用户不能进行钱包操作。”\n\n就在那里写着，\n\n大家以后好好做人，要不然分分钟办你！\n\n我是一直做良民！","raw_text":{"text":"突发：人民币以后冻结钱更方便了！\n\n——数字人民币真的要来了——\n高校已经开始用于发工资！\n\n这都不是重点，\n重点是用这个：冻结更方便、无隐私、用途限制 ……全部都是so easy\n\n不信？看图一，\n中国银行数字人民币钱包协议明确规定：运营机构可在无需用户确认的情况下停用钱包，停用后用户不能进行钱包操作。”\n\n就在那里写着，\n\n大家以后好好做人，要不然分分钟办你！\n\n我是一直做良民！","display_text_range":[0,193],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[100,123],"id":"2114671251080065024","display":"pic.x.com/3f8h0lmhnh","original":"https://t.co/3f8h0lmhnh","replacement":"https://x.com/btcmos/status/2114671276241637662/photo/1"},{"type":"media","indices":[100,123],"id":"2114671266456387584","display":"pic.x.com/3f8h0lmhnh","original":"https://t.co/3f8h0lmhnh","replacement":"https://x.com/btcmos/status/2114671276241637662/photo/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"btcmos","url":"https://x.com/btcmos","id":"1865722200185307136","followers":61794,"following":28944,"likes":126239,"media_count":969,"statuses":9027,"name":"香港老雷","description":"美股老韭｜BTC玩家｜加密合约｜AI资讯|AI投资｜数据整理｜WEIBO：香港老雷","raw_description":{"text":"美股老韭｜BTC玩家｜加密合约｜AI资讯|AI投资｜数据整理｜WEIBO：香港老雷","facets":[]},"location":"Japan","banner_url":"","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1888127766488625152/Fiba7f5J_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sun Dec 08 11:37:14 +0000 2024","protected":false,"website":null,"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"type":"profile"},"replies":43,"reposts":7,"likes":95,"bookmarks":34,"quotes":1,"embed_card":"summary_large_image","created_at":"Mon Oct 26 10:51:35 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1793011895,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":26133,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null,"lang":"zh","replying_to":null,"media":{"all":[{"type":"photo","id":"2114671251080065024","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVjSTIFbsAAS8t8.jpg?name=orig","width":1284,"height":1548},{"type":"photo","id":"21146