,"height":1305},{"type":"photo","id":"2114604169982337025","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HViVSfhbYAE5Qli.jpg?name=orig","width":892,"height":1154}],"photos":[{"type":"photo","id":"2114604145114304513","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HViVRC4bUAEsTuU.jpg?name=orig","width":1079,"height":676},{"type":"photo","id":"2114604157739180032","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HViVRx6boAApljc.jpg?name=orig","width":1079,"height":1305},{"type":"photo","id":"2114604169982337025","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HViVSfhbYAE5Qli.jpg?name=orig","width":892,"height":1154}],"mosaic":{"type":"mosaic_photo","formats":{"jpeg":"https://mosaic.fxtwitter.com/jpeg/2114604180371620112/HViVRC4bUAEsTuU/HViVRx6boAApljc/HViVSfhbYAE5Qli","webp":"https://mosaic.fxtwitter.com/webp/2114604180371620112/HViVRC4bUAEsTuU/HViVRx6boAApljc/HViVSfhbYAE5Qli"}}},"provider":"twitter","reposted_by":null},{"type":"status","url":"https://x.com/btcmos/status/2114601139752804804","id":"2114601139752804804","text":"中国法院——丈夫砍死出轨妻子，法院认定妻子有责任\n\n——我认为妻子应该无责——\n\n妻子有道德问题，但不应有任何法责。\n\n这判决死缓我支持，\n但是我不支持妻子有责任这句话！\n这话纯纯就是领导搞政治正确和为了平息民间对婚姻法用脚投票。\n\n｜\n中国当前的婚姻法太过变态，\n把大家绑定的太死，把财产绑定太死。\n越这样搞，夫妻关系越容易出事！\n\n松绑一点，\n\n大家就会精神松弛，\n可能会有契约奇效。","raw_text":{"text":"中国法院——丈夫砍死出轨妻子，法院认定妻子有责任\n\n——我认为妻子应该无责——\n\n妻子有道德问题，但不应有任何法责。\n\n这判决死缓我支持，\n但是我不支持妻子有责任这句话！\n这话纯纯就是领导搞政治正确和为了平息民间对婚姻法用脚投票。\n\n｜\n中国当前的婚姻法太过变态，\n把大家绑定的太死，把财产绑定太死。\n越这样搞，夫妻关系越容易出事！\n\n松绑一点，\n\n大家就会精神松弛，\n可能会有契约奇效。","display_text_range":[0,194],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[133,156],"id":"2114601117716025344","display":"pic.x.com/muyPLuLlXf","original":"https://t.co/muyPLuLlXf","replacement":"https://x.com/btcmos/status/2114601139752804804/photo/1"},{"type":"media","indices":[133,156],"id":"2114601128918986752","display":"pic.x.com/muyPLuLlXf","original":"https://t.co/muyPLuLlXf","replacement":"https://x.com/btcmos/status/2114601139752804804/photo/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"btcmos","url":"https://x.com/btcmos","id":"1865722200185307136","followers":61794,"f